    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610360/extras/d145a2dfe5b934b50326a003c5eca5c1.avif?t=1732762502\" /></div><br><br>Little trouble in Big Japano-verse! A bunch of gamer friends, turned into actual characters...?<br>Explore the world of &quot;UKIYO&quot; as player &quot;Kai&quot; in Samurai Cat form, and solve the mystery of WHY HERE? and WHY US!?!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME MECHANICS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610360/extras/f73467b2812ad3a6496c11745b597a79.avif?t=1732762502\" /></div><br><br>This game is a story-driven adventure game. Use the game controller to control the main character, Kai, and go through the story. Talk to people in town and inspect various items to solve the mystery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique characters in the form of animals<br></li><li>Beautiful background art<br></li><li>Unique theme of Japanese-style cyberpunk</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610360/extras/d145a2dfe5b934b50326a003c5eca5c1.avif?t=1732762502\" /></div><br><br>Little trouble in Big Japano-verse! A bunch of gamer friends, turned into actual characters...?<br>Explore the world of &quot;UKIYO&quot; as player &quot;Kai&quot; in Samurai Cat form, and solve the mystery of WHY HERE? and WHY US!?!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME MECHANICS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610360/extras/f73467b2812ad3a6496c11745b597a79.avif?t=1732762502\" /></div><br><br>This game is a story-driven adventure game. Use the game controller to control the main character, Kai, and go through the story. Talk to people in town and inspect various items to solve the mystery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique characters in the form of animals<br></li><li>Beautiful background art<br></li><li>Unique theme of Japanese-style cyberpunk</li></ul>",
